{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_04",
  "title": "話桑麻",
  "storyCode": "HS-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "155540fb49f2b3576fb13ed5de10136415c9d8c3c8a8e296e366bbf981816333",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g10_fairyfarmland_ex"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "望不到頭的稻田，迷離如幻。天地寬廣，卻萬籟俱寂。\n一絲酒香飄過，雲做旋舞，飄飄然流入一隻酒盞。\n仰頭飲盡，瞬間天朗氣清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……真是一場好夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼有功夫來我這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這最近不是很熱鬧？正好來看看你答應我的高粱酒釀好沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在夢裡，我怎麼把酒給你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的是哪一年的酒，這又是你的哪個夢呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夢裡喝不到，讓我聞聞味道也好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者是來看看我那個最辛苦的妹妹，最近是不是又累瘦了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來這就是小年做出來的奇妙物件？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "詩人揮一揮衣袖，手邊便出現一壇酒，兩隻盞。\n她抬手拍碎壇口的泥封，陳年酒香霎時蔓延。\n詩人回身，眺望。稻田綿延百里、萬里，春夏秋冬於天空中盤旋，寒來暑往，春去秋來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你在這顆“心臟”裡看到的風景？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無盡的稻田，輪轉的四季，你每日都在耕作，這裡真能造出你們說的那個東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需不需要我也來幫你們一把？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怕你來了，這個容器也會變成一個大酒缸，或者是突然有了自己的想法，覺得世間不逍遙，不如長夢不醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的不需要我幫忙？你在這裡待了多少年，我都快要記不清了，再不出來走走就怕你憋成我的酒葫蘆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別的弟弟妹妹，只怕是看不清事裡事外，只有你，我只擔心你看得太透。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得太透，就看不到“自己”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過是在這裡耕種罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "山水草木皆有情，這一草一木在你看來，也未必和我們的生命有什麼區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有什麼放不下的東西呢，你還會在意什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頡曾經也留下過那麼多書卷字帖，她希望能教每個人讀書識字。但她走後，那些字帖書文也一同消失，除了我們，沒人記得她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可後來我去過幾所學堂，還有天師府，看到有些書本中用的字跡，竟和她的一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她那些東西早都沒有了，連我都沒能留下哪怕一張，但她說過的話又從那些學生的嘴裡說了出來，寫過的字又在那些學生的筆下復現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得她和我說過，“重要的是我能留下來的”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我只是在看，這片稻田的盡頭，能留下什麼。如果有一日我也消散了，我能為這裡留下什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一直在看著的那個結局，有改變嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白茫茫一片大雪，從來沒有變過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……春種秋收，繁盛過後，最後都被一場大雪掩埋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對這個結果，你會失望嗎？還是覺得遺憾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來這世間走過一遭，這本身不就是結果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像這世上無數人一樣，有誰是想著生命有一個終點，就無所適從了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "令",
      "speakerId": "avg_2023_ling_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，我們有的兄弟不這麼想……那位弟弟，他回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "原來那個膽小又乖巧的績去哪裡了呢？\n唉，這些弟弟妹妹，還是小時候比較可愛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我會去見見他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g3_fieldpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一、二、三……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大嗓門，這些到底是什麼新品種啊？我好像從來沒看過，長得還挺好看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了你也聽不懂，別多嘴，幫我找就對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，叫人幫忙還這麼大脾氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了大嗓門，我還想問你一個事情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是天師府的學徒嗎，而且我認識的人裡，除了黍姐姐和小禾，就數你懂得最多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要問什麼，趕緊說啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你……有沒有見過我的爸爸媽媽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*炎國粗口*天師府上上下下多少人，你以為我是警衛大爺，把每個人都記得清清楚楚？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "腦子被泥砸傻了吧你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道就不知道嘛，幹嘛突然兇人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼想起來要問我這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天我見到了一個奇怪的商人，他說他是從大荒城外面，從很遠的地方來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍姐姐說，我的爸媽也是去很遠的地方當天師了。但是不知道他們到底是去做什麼，這麼多年都沒回來，也從來沒有聽別人說起過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大嗓門，你真的不能幫我打聽打聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不用讓他們回來，我就是想寫封信告訴他們，大荒城快搬家了，搬上了移動地塊。他們回家的時候別找不到路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……行了，不用白擔心。你當天師府是什麼地方，到該回家的時候，肯定有人帶他們回家的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洪水影響過的地塊，就到這裡為止了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好像是的……\n怎麼了？你要找的這種水稻，跟洪水有關係嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不該問的別問，天師府的工作，說了你也不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神氣什麼！小禾說過，只要我耐著性子多看幾本書，憑我的源石技藝天賦，肯定也能考上天師府的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好，那就等你考上了再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，我託你找水稻這件事，千萬別跟別人講啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "為……\n算了，你肯定不會說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂……你最近，過得還好？有沒有受欺負？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……挺開心的啊。小禾和黍姐姐都挺照顧我，職農大伯大嬸們人也很好，最近還認識了小燭台和小毛筆兩個新朋友……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼問題？你關心我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰關心你這個野丫頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，今天還是辛苦你了，照顧好自己吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次要是有人欺負你，你就照我教你的，用笛子敲他的頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g12_cityoperastage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "桑麻日已長，我土日已廣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敢教邪祟詭魔拓易，天地煥新光……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啦……啦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直不喜歡這尊塑像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰說“神農”就一定得是短褐穿結，飽經風霜的樣子？明明她也是很愛美的，她總是在髮髻上戴著花，也很喜歡我做的衣裳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我記得很清楚，她的眼睛，和你很像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是能讓夕給她留下一幅畫像該多好……可惜那個時候，夕好像也還沒有學會畫畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為你不會再回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再怎麼講我也不是離家出走的年紀，我又什麼時候說過不會回來的話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊子漂泊在外久了總會想家的，想來想去，也只有這裡能算我的家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偏偏是這個時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是能早兩天回來，還能趕上今年的社戲，再嚐嚐你包的麥穗餃子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以啊，“遠行的餃子，回家的麵”，想吃什麼，家裡都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃完飯，就又該上路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼我才留下不到兩天，就這麼急著趕我走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是只是回來歇歇，想留多久都可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是想問問你，你真的只是回來歇歇的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次回來，大荒城都要變一番模樣。誰還能想到，千年前這裡還是一片凍土的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是人們從緊挨著邪祟詭魔的地方搶下了這一片土地。那時候，山河混沌，天無四時，但是人心明亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人們不分身分，不分國別，互相扶持，敵人只有眼前的荒地，還有不知什麼時候會出現的邪魔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前幾天，我還夢見過她，也夢見過那位老先生。所以我想，可能是時候回來看看了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所幸還能找到回家的路，只可惜……人心不古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你又有多久，沒好好看過這裡的人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天下熙熙，皆為利來；天下攘攘，皆為利往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "利在哪，人就在哪。哪都一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，你覺得朝廷裡的人，商量的到底是如何保住我們一家人的性命，還是如何尋求一個對他們而言最穩妥的局面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你真的相信，年的那個造物，可以保所有人的平安？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是唯一可以保大家性命的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是把性命交到別人手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雙方合伙做生意，有利一起賺，風險卻只有一邊承擔。這不是一筆划算買賣，至少不是筆公平的買賣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要想生意做得長久，那至少要讓雙方背著一樣的風險才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遠行了這麼久，你在意的就只有帳本上的盈虧了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在意的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，你累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為這裡的一草一木操勞還不夠，又幫年去做那個工程，是很耗神的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然的話，這次的事，你本該更早發現的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千年來，無數次天災，每一次，天災降臨在這片土地上，你都會提前知道……這片土地上的一切，你都會感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底在堅持些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，誰才是逆天而行的那一個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g8_crestofweir"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，你看到了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了……什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等……你怎麼知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左樂手上捻著一縷絲線，眼看著它很快消失在了空氣中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是有人在惡作劇……大概是源石技藝吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到的那些東西應該是你自己的幻覺，但有他想讓你看到的東西，就像是某種心理暗示……你看到了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好像看到了一位老農，他……或者是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我在地裡耕種。我種不出莊稼，但是越來越老，再沒力氣拿起鋤頭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有河對岸的樹上掛著不少木牌，那邊沒人過去過，但我看到了上面好像寫著人名……那個老農也消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……河對岸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他讓你看見河對岸……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "禾生嘆了口氣，順著河流向遠處眺望。\n河對岸的樹木鬱鬱蔥蔥，一陣風刮過，似乎還能聽到樹葉沙沙作響的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小禾，小燭台，你們在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小滿姑娘！你到哪裡去了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我剛剛找水稻去了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找水稻？你不是去找牧獸了？什麼水稻需要專門去找？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g3_fieldpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴躁的天師學徒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1238_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有，我託你找水稻這件事，千萬別跟別人講啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g8_crestofweir"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應過別人……要保密的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇奇怪怪……怎麼盡是讓人摸不著頭腦的事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是誰要你找水稻？什麼樣子的水稻？在哪裡找到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小燭台？你怎麼這麼緊張……有點可怕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小滿姑娘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好好我說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是一個天師府的小個子學生……說要找特殊品種的水稻用來交作業……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不知道是什麼種類……只是看上去像是紅色的，紅得發黑……在堰口有一些，離這不遠的水田裡也有一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g8_crestofweir"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小滿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小禾，前些日子收上來的糧食都放在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大荒城有集中的糧倉，在核心城裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能請你現在就去查看一下糧倉嗎？如果有什麼異狀，立刻去找老鄉長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "speakerId": "avg_4119_wanqin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等……到底是什麼事這麼著急？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_4121_zuole_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕已經來不及了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g12_cityoperastage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的社戲一共是三齣，《大狩天》《爭天時》《萬物生》。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但很早之前，在第一、二齣之間應該還有一齣《度北疆》，很久都不唱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，你還記得該怎麼唱嗎？能不能再唱一段？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調子還記得，詞已經差不多忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是陳年舊事，沒什麼好唱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，台下沒有觀眾，唱戲也沒勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過眼就忘的戲，看起來也沒勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我還記得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得，北方的這一塊邪魔碎片，是當時的人不擇手段尋來對付祂的方法，祂的化身如今卻在幫人們抵擋邪魔的災害。實在是有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們早就不該再和祂混為一談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確不該。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "邪祟詭魔，絕不能為普通百姓所知，但偏偏一片罕見的少受源石污染的土地就在這裡，實在沒辦法放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一千年來，這裡的人們就生活在與那片穢土一河之隔的地方。人們也真的在這裡埋頭耕作，不問世事，持續了一千年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有因有果。千年前，人們自己種下的因，現在，也該有人來摘這個果了。還得是合適的人才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……告訴我，那場災害，和你無關，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我何時對你說過假話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是有時候會選擇不說真話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你這次回來，到底是想做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我剛才說的，只是回家看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "績",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1236_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是跟以前一樣，只是想問問你，姐姐，要不要跟我一起走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我的回答也是跟以前一樣，我不會離開，也不想離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
